2 CONC neral biographical dictionary, Volume 2, Antipater article 5.Jump up ^ Ptolemaic Genealogy: Berenice I, Footnote 3 6.Jump up ^ Heckel, Who’s who in the age of Alexander the Great: prosopography of Alexander’s empire, p.71 7.Jump u
2 CONC p ^ Heckel, Who’s who in the age of Alexander the Great: prosopography of Alexander’s empire, p.71
