2 CONT KINGDOM OF THE BOSPORUS AND BECAME KING ca. 100 BC; ULTIMATELY DEFEATED IN THE
2 CONT THREE MITHRADATIC WARS (88-84, 83-81, 74-63) BY LUCIUS CORNELIUS SULLA, LUCIUS
