2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Ptolemy XIII of Egypt  Mother: Cleopatra V Tryphaena of Egypt
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 MARC @ ANTHONY OF ROME b: 83 BC Married: Children
2 CONT  Cleopatra Selene b: 40 BC
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source: http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=jdp-fam&id=I62179
