1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ptolemy XV Philopator, Philometer Caesar, Caesarion, King of Egypt, King of Kings, Iwapanetjer entynehem (Heir of the god who saves), Setepenptah (Chosen of Ptah), Irmaatenre (Carrying out the rule of Ra), Sekheman
2 CONC khamun (Living image of Amun), was born June 23, 47 BC, Egypt; died (by strangulation) August 30, BC, Alexandria, Egypt.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
