2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caesarion
2 CONT
2 CONT Born June 23, 47 BC 
2 CONT
2 CONT Died August 23, 30 BC (aged 17) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Predecessor Cleopatra VII Philopator 
2 CONT
