2 CONT Wagner, Sir Anthony Richard; ‘Pedigree and Progress: Essays in the Genealogical Interpretation of History’ has Julia of Chalcis' as Tigranes' wife. Wikipedia above does not cite her as his wife, although cites a Julia as his daugh
2 CONC ter?  
