2 CONT *Schwartz, Seth (1990). Josephus and Judaean politics. Columbia studies in the classical tradition. *Leiden, New York: Brill. pp. 137. ISBN 9004092307. OCLC 21595783.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Julia_(daughter_of_Tigranes_VI_of_Armenia)
2 CONT
