2 CONT The family of Trdat ou Tiridates (tg) II d'ARMÉNIE and ..
2 CONT
2 CONT [128924] ARMÉNIE (d'), Trdat ou Tiridates (tg) II (Chrosov ou Chosroes Ier (tg) & .. [128923]), roi d'Arménie, born about 195, died 252 or 253
2 CONT
2 CONT * married about 225
