1 NOTE MARSKALK OG VISEKONGE
1 NOTE commander of Emperor Maurices armies in an attack on Thrace
2 CONT His army destroyed in a great slaughter, the Thracians arrested him, bound him
2 CONT him to a tall tree in the forest, and killed him
1 NOTE OR "MOUSHEL"; MARZPAN (VICEROY) 591-593
