1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mahadathika Mahanaga was King of Anuradhapura in the 1st century CE. His reign lasted from 9 CE to 21 CE. He succeeded his brother, Bhatikabhaya Abhaya as King of Anuradhapura and was succeeded by his son, Amandaga
2 CONC mani Abhaya.
