2 CONT
2 CONT >However, Grimo does not reveal who his parents were. He mentions his late sister Ermengundis, who also led a spiritual life as a deaconess (dyacona) . He calls a Duke Bobo his nephew. Whether it is the duke who died in 639 at the
2 CONC  side of the young King Sigibert III. (around 630-656) fought against the Thuringian Duke Radulf (died after 642) is not certain. Grimo calls two other nephews sons of Ado (his brother?).
