1 NOTE {geni:about_me} KURU'S 11th GENERATION DOWN BELOW WERE PANDAVAS. IN AN ENCOUNTER PANDAVAS HAD WITH ONE GANDHAVA  (WHILE ON THE WAY TO PANCHALA), GANDHARVA NARRATED THE INCIDENT TO PANDAVAS.
