2 CONT
2 CONT '''Princess Kata''' or '''Katay''' (Georgian: კატა; კატაჲ) was a Georgian royal princess (batonishvili) of the Bagrationi dynasty.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of King George I of Georgia. She was a wife of Abbas I of Kars (984—1029).
