2 CONT From https://www.quora.com/Is-Goddess-Ganga-God-Shivas-wife
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the Skanda Purana , Shiva marries both the daughters of Himavan.These two daughters are Ganga and Uma(Parvathi). That is one reason we call Ganesha as Gangeya .
2 CONT
2 CONT In the Treta Yuga , Bhagiratha prays for Ganga to be brought to earth. When ganga was ordered the same , she felt insulted and decides to flood the entire earth. Knowing this , Bhagiratha prays to Shiva to save them . Shiva appear
2 CONC s in the way and traps Ganga in his hairlocks . This is another folklore behind the story of Ganga being the second wife of Shiva.
