2 CONC pad records that "le baron Sempad, seigneur de Babaron, le baron Vasil, seigneur de Partzerpert, le baron Derin et le baron Tigrane" were killed at "Mecis" in [12 Feb 1151/11 Feb 1152][934].  The Chronicle of Sempad records his de
2 CONC ath "before the gate of Mecis"[935]. 
