2 CONT  	 	  Vidyavan guni ati chatur	 	You are the repository of learning, virtuous and fully accom- Ram kaj karibe ko aatur	 	plished, always keen to carry out the behest's of Shri Ram.
2 CONT  	 	  Prabu charitra sunibe ko rasiya	 	You are an ardent listener, always so keen to listen to the Ram Lakhan Sita man Basiya	 	narration of Shri Ram's Life Stories. Your heart is filled with
2 CONT  	 	what Shri Ram stood for. You therefore always dwell in the
2 CONT  	 	hearts of Shri Ram, Lakshman and Sita.
2 CONT  	 	  Sukshma roop dhari Siyahi dikhava	 	You appeared before Sita in a Diminutive form and spoke to Vikat roop dhari lanka jarava	 	her in humility. You assumed an awesome form and struck
2 CONT  	 	terror by setting Lanka on fire.
2 CONT  	 	  Bhima roop dhari asur sanghare	 	With over-whelming might you destroyed the Asuras Ramachandra ke kaj sanvare	 	(demons) and performed all tasks assigned to you by Shri Ram
2 CONT  	 	with great skill.
2 CONT  	 	  Laye Sanjivan Lakhan Jiyaye	 	You brought Sanjivan (A herb that revives life) and restored Shri Raghuvir Harashi ur laye	 	Lakshman back to life, Shri Raghuvir (Shri Ram) cheerfully
2 CONT  	 	embraced you with his heart full of joy.
2 CONT  	 	  Raghupati Kinhi bahut badai	 	Shri Raghupati (Shri Ram) lustily extolled your excellence and Tum mam priye Bharat-hi sam bhai	 	said: "You are as dear to me as my own brother Bharat."
2 CONT  	 	  Sahas badan tumharo yash gaave	 	Thousands of living beings are chanting hymns of your glories; Us kahi Shripati kanth lagaave	 	saying thus, Shri Ram warmly hugged him (Shri Hanuman).
2 CONT  	 	  Sankadik Brahmadi Muneesa	 	When prophets like Sanka, even the Sage like Lord Brahma, Narad Sarad sahit Aheesa	 	the great hermit Narad himself, Goddess Saraswati and Ahisha
2 CONT  	 	(one of immeasurable dimensions).
2 CONT  	 	  Yam Kuber Digpal Jahan te	 	Even Yamraj (God of Death) Kuber (God of Wealth) and the Kavi kovid kahi sake kahan te	 	Digpals (deputies guarding the four corners of the Universe)
2 CONT  	 	have been vying with one another in offering homage to your
2 CONT  	 	glories. How then, can a mere poet give adequate expression
2 CONT  	 	of your super excellence.
2 CONT  	 	  Tum upkar Sugreevahin keenha	 	You rendered a great service to Sugriv. You united him with Ram milaye rajpad deenha	 	Shri Ram and he installed him on the Royal Throne. By heeding Tumharo mantra Vibheeshan mana	 	your advice
2 CONC , Vibhishan became Lord of Lanka. This is known Lankeshwar Bhaye Sub jag jana	 	all over the Universe.
2 CONT  	 	  Yug sahastra jojan par Bhanu	 	On your own you dashed upon the Sun, which is at a fabulous Leelyo tahi madhur phal janu	 	distance of thousands of miles, thinking it to be a sweet
2 CONT  	 	luscious fruit.
2 CONT  	 	  Prabhu mudrika meli mukh mahee	 	Carrying the Lord's Signet Ring in your mouth, there is Jaladhi langhi gaye achraj nahee	 	hardly any wonder that you easily leapt across the ocean.
2 CONT  	 	  Durgaam kaj jagat ke jete	 	The burden of all difficult tasks of the world become light Sugam anugraha tumhre tete	 	with your kind grace.
2 CONT  	 	  Ram dware tum rakhvare,	 	You are the sentry at the door of Shri Ram's Divine Abode. Hoat na agya binu paisare	 	No one can enter it without your permission,
2 CONT  	 	  Sub sukh lahai tumhari sarna	 	All comforts of the world lie at your feet. The devotees enjoy all Tum rakshak kahu ko dar na	 	divine pleasures and feel fearless under your benign Protection.
2 CONT  	 	  Aapan tej samharo aapai	 	You alone are befitted to carry your own splendid valour. All the Teenhon lok hank te kanpai	 	three worlds (entire universe) tremor at your thunderous call.
2 CONT  	 	  Bhoot pisach Nikat nahin aavai	 	All the ghosts, demons and evil forces keep away, with the Mahavir jab naam sunavai	 	sheer mention of your great name, O'Mahaveer!!
2 CONT  	 	  Nase rog harai sab peera	 	All diseases, pain and suffering disappear on reciting regularly Japat nirantar Hanumant beera	 	Shri Hanuman's holy name.
2 CONT  	 	  Sankat se Hanuman chudavai	 	Those who remember Shri Hanuman in thought, words and deeds Man Karam Vachan dyan jo lavai	 	with Sincerity and Faith, are rescued from all crises in life.
2 CONT  	 	  Sub par Ram tapasvee raja	 	All who hail, worship and have faith in Shri Ram as the Supreme Tin ke kaj sakal Tum saja	 	Lord and the king of penance. You make all their difficult tasks
2 CONT  	 	very easy.
2 CONT  	 	  Aur manorath jo koi lavai	 	Whosoever comes to you for fulfillment of any desire with faith Sohi amit jeevan phal pavai	 	and sincerity, Will he alone secure the imperishable fruit of
2 CONT  	 	human life.
2 CONT  	 	  Charon Yug partap tumhara	 	All through the four ages your magnificent glory is acclaimed far
