2 CONC ce (mother), and Sempad, Hethum, Oshin, Basil, Leo, Vacaghk, Kalamarie, Stephanie and Hripsimeh, virgin (brothers and sisters), Philipp and Mariam Ibelin (children of Kalamarie)"[1032].  Lord of Korikos.  Smbat Sparapet's Chronicl
2 CONC e records that "the Armenian king held a general levee with his brothers Smbat…lord of Paperon, Smbataklay, Astaros, Farxni, Papatul, Sik and Murandin, and Oshin lord of…Kurikos, Mitizon, Manion, Kanch" in [15 Jan 1263/14 Jan 1264
2 CONC ] before travelling to "the Gate of Antioch…awaiting the infidels", but that "Oshin brother of King Hetum and lord of Kurikos" died 26 Dec and was buried at Sis "near the tomb of his father"[1033].  The Chronicle attributed to Kin
2 CONC g Hethum II records that "paron Oshin…brother of the Armenian king and the lord of Korikos" died "Friday 25 Dec" in [14 Jan 1265/13 Jan 1266][1034]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ALIX, daughter of [KOSTANDIN Lord of Lampron & his wife Stephanie of Barbaron].  Her parentage is indicated by the children of Oshin of Korikos being described as nephews of Oshin the Marshal[1035].  The primary source whi
2 CONC ch confirms her name has not yet been identified. 
