0 @N6000000002187600540@ NOTE Sames
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Sames was the founder of the Kingdom of Sophene and the city of Samosata first mentioned by Eratosthenes in 245 BC. Ziaelas of Bithynia took refuge at the court of Sames in Samosata in 260 BC.
