1 CONT Pedigree 
1 CONT       Presiding Prince of the Bagratids. Smbat III Bagratuni was Sources: 1. Toumanoff, C. 'The Orontids of Armenia' in 'Studies in Christian Caucasian History' (1963) pp.337-342. ; 2. Toumanoff, C. 'The Early Bagratids' in La Mus
