0 @N6000000002187705492@ NOTE Ashur-resh-ishi I
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT
1 CONT Ashur-resh-ishi I was King of Assyria from 1133 to 1115 BC. He succeeded his father, Mutakkil-Nusku, and was succeeded by his son Tiglath-Pileser I.
1 CONT
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT Mutakkil-Nusku King of Assyria
1 CONT 1133–1115 Succeeded by:
1 CONT Tiglath-Pileser I 
